      "x": 258,
      "y": 445,
      "width": 185,
      "height": 85,
      "text": "1. Worker calls ask_human\n2. Save checkpoint, exit worker\n3. Notify user (WebSocket)\n4. User responds via API\n5. Re-enqueue resume_agent\n6. Worker restores checkpoint",
