    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "correctness-text",
      "x": 1340,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 353.147705078125,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "1. CORRECTNESS\n\nGenerate output with agent, compare against ground truth\n\n1. All 4 sheets present (Vendor Payments, Raw Data,\n    Payment Holds, Previously Uploaded)\n2. All expected columns in each sheet\n3. Vendor Payments row count within ±5 of expected *\n4. Raw Data preserves all input rows (150)\n5. Payment Holds not empty (filtering worked)\n6. Amount totals within 5% of ground truth output *\n7. Bill Payment ID + GL Account fields present *\n8. Vendor names standardized correctly\n9. Payment hold vendors excluded from Vendor Payments",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 511,
      "groupIds": [],
      "version": 51,
      "versionNonce": 549977267,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "roughness": 1,
      "index": "b0e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774027789521,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. CORRECTNESS\n\nGenerate output with agent, compare against ground truth\n\n1. All 4 sheets present (Vendor Payments, Raw Data,\n    Payment Holds, Previously Uploaded)\n2. All expected columns in each sheet\n3. Vendor Payments row count within ±5 of expected *\n4. Raw Data preserves all input rows (150)\n5. Payment Holds not empty (filtering worked)\n6. Amount totals within 5% of ground truth output *\n7. Bill Payment ID + GL Account fields present *\n8. Vendor names standardized correctly\n9. Payment hold vendors excluded from Vendor Payments",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
