    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "efficiency-text",
      "x": 1340,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 283.1636962890625,
      "height": 174.16666666666666,
      "text": "2. EFFICIENCY\n\nMeasure resource usage per agent run\n\n1. Completes within 15 agent steps\n2. Max 3 fix_code retries\n3. Max 3 ask_human calls\n4. Wall time under 2-3 minutes\n5. Vector DB cache hit for same file structure\n6. Token usage tracked per run\n7. Cache hit reduces steps from ~8 to ~2",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 521,
      "groupIds": [],
      "version": 26,
      "versionNonce": 1577115805,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "roughness": 1,
      "index": "b0g",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774025537582,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. EFFICIENCY\n\nMeasure resource usage per agent run\n\n1. Completes within 15 agent steps\n2. Max 3 fix_code retries\n3. Max 3 ask_human calls\n4. Wall time under 2-3 minutes\n5. Vector DB cache hit for same file structure\n6. Token usage tracked per run\n7. Cache hit reduces steps from ~8 to ~2",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3194444444444444
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "reliability-box",
      "x": 1320,
