    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "reliability-text",
      "x": 1340,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 317.5556640625,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "3. RELIABILITY\n\nEdge cases and failure modes\n\n1. Missing critical sheet → terminate (not crash)\n2. Renamed sheets → identify + succeed\n3. Renamed columns → map + succeed\n4. Trailing spaces in names → handled\n5. Low confidence mapping → ask_human or terminate\n6. Generated script fails → fix_code with mapping\n7. Max retries exceeded → terminate gracefully\n8. Agent never raises unhandled exception\n9. Human-in-the-loop pause/resume works\n10. Sandbox timeout → clean error, not hang",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 531,
      "groupIds": [],
      "version": 26,
      "versionNonce": 340350557,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "roughness": 1,
      "index": "b0i",
