      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774025572207,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. RELIABILITY\n\nEdge cases and failure modes\n\n1. Missing critical sheet → terminate (not crash)\n2. Renamed sheets → identify + succeed\n3. Renamed columns → map + succeed\n4. Trailing spaces in names → handled\n5. Low confidence mapping → ask_human or terminate\n6. Generated script fails → fix_code with mapping\n7. Max retries exceeded → terminate gracefully\n8. Agent never raises unhandled exception\n9. Human-in-the-loop pause/resume works\n10. Sandbox timeout → clean error, not hang",
      "autoResize": true,
